2:T49e,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","@id":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/iboy-football-commentator#blogposting","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/iboy-football-commentator","headline":"iBoy Football Commentator Voice","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/iboy-football-commentator","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Guy Harris","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceoverguy","image":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/images/guy-harris-profile.jpg"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"VoiceoverGuy","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.webp"}},"inLanguage":"en-GB","isAccessibleForFree":true,"description":"iBoy Football Commentator – Guy Harris recorded a football-style commentary cameo for the Netflix film iBoy. Hear the clip and explore more football commentator","datePublished":"2017-02-01T00:00:00+00:00","dateModified":"2017-02-01T00:00:00+00:00","keywords":["football commentator sport announcer"],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/img/blog/iboy-football-commentator.jpg"}}4:T670,<h2>Why do I get so many footy jobs?</h2>
<p>It always makes me laugh that I don’t actually watch football, yet I’m forever booked for <a href="https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/football-commentator-voice" title="Football commentator style voice" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">football commentator-style voiceovers</a>. Even ITV once asked me to voice the promo for a new series of Play to the Whistle, which turned out really well.</p>

<p>My commentary work now includes jobs for <a href="https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/betfred-football-commentator" title="Betfred football commentator" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Betfred</a>, <a href="https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/just-eat-uefa-football-commentator-voice" title="Just Eat UEFA Commentary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Just Eat UEFA</a>, <a href="https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/pizza-hut-delivery-football-commentator-voiceover" title="Pizza Hut football voiceover" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Pizza Hut</a>, <a href="https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/manchester-city-football-commentry-voice" title="Man City commentator voice" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Manchester City</a>, and even international brands like <a href="https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/turkish-airlines-football-commentator-voiceover" title="Turkish Airlines football commentary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Turkish Airlines</a>. Not bad for someone who doesn’t follow football.</p>

<p>It was another voiceover friend who told me I’d ended up commentating on Spurs and Man U in this Netflix film. I didn’t even realise at the time!</p>5:T41a,<h2>Need a football commentator voice?</h2>
<p>If you’re working on a promo, trailer, sketch, or commercial and need a fast, energetic football commentator style, feel free to get in touch. I can send a short sample before you book me. Just send over a few lines of script and I’ll record something so you know I’m the right fit.</p>

<p>You can also hear more examples on my main <a href="https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/football-commentator-voice" title="Football Commentator Voiceover" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">football commentator voiceover page</a>, which includes global brands, UEFA campaigns, comedy reads, and more.</p>
<div style="margin:20px 0;">
    <audio controls style="width:100%; max-width:420px;">
        <source src="/assets/audio/football-commentator-showreel-guy-harris.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
        Your browser does not support the audio element.
    </audio>
    <p style="font-size:0.9em; opacity:0.8; margin-top:5px;">
        Football Commentator Showreel – Guy Harris
    </p>
</div>8:["slug","iboy-football-commentator","d"]
