a football-style commentary cameo for the Netflix film iBoy. Hear the clip and explore more football commentator\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container page-header-nav-wrap","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-content","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"iBoy Football Commentator Voice"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>I had the chance to voice a small football-commentary style part in Netflix’s indie superhero film iBoy. It’s only a blink-and-you’ll-miss-me moment, but great fun to do and another quirky addition to the growing list of <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Football Commentator Voice\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">football commentator voiceovers</a> I seem to attract.</p>"}}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-arrows","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/doggie-doo-voice-over","className":"page-header-arrow","title":"Doggie Doo voice over","aria-label":"Previous: Doggie Doo voice over","children":"‹"}],["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/siegecraft-commander-trailer-voice","className":"page-header-arrow","title":"Siegecraft Commander Trailer Voice","aria-label":"Next: Siegecraft Commander Trailer Voice","children":"›"}]]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$4"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lgHexqrHh0s","title":"iBoy Football Commentator Voice","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-card","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/iboy-football-commentator.jpg","alt":"iboy-football-commentator","className":"blog-post-img"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-caption","children":"iBoy Football Commentator Voice"}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>More about iBoy</h2>\r\n<p>If you haven’t seen it, iBoy follows Tom, a teenager whose life changes after an encounter with local thugs leaves smartphone fragments embedded in his brain. After waking from a coma, he discovers he has strange new powers and sets out for revenge, along with trying to protect his friend Lucy.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It’s a gritty, clever British sci-fi film, and it was fun to provide a little moment of commentary within it. Another unusual gig to add to the ever-growing football commentary list.</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$5"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L6",null,{"pageTitle":"iBoy Football Commentator Voice","pageUrl":"iboy-football-commentator"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","627",{"href":"/seat-hidden-heroes-adrian","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/seat-hidden-heroes-adrian.jpg","alt":"Seat Hidden Heroes Adrian","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Seat Hidden Heroes Adrian"}]]}],["$","$L3","8